	"Description": "[size=4][b]Description[/b][/size]\n<br />[color=#D4D4D8]Run\u00A0your\u00A0own\u00A0Floral\u00A0Shop,\u00A0Restaurant,\u00A0Fish\u00A0Market,\u00A0and\u00A0more.\n<br />Display your cooking and farming, and expect lots of customers browsing, making purchases,\n<br />or simply delighting in your exquisite decorations.\u00A0 adapted for [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/44436]SMAPI NRTnarathip[/url] android. [/color]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Main features[/b][/size]\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][color=#D4D4D8]Set up your store anywhere, villagers will drop by and buy your items[/color][/*]\n<br />[*][color=#D4D4D8]Turn your Farm buildings\u00A0into a store or museum by obtaining a License[/color][/*]\n<br />[*][color=#D4D4D8]Invite friends\u00A0to visit your house the next day!!! Children may ask to play on your farm too![/color][/*]\n<br />[*][color=#D4D4D8]Gather your customers' reviews\u00A0and be the best market in town.[/color][/*]\n<br />[*][color=#D4D4D8]Turn the island into a Paradise, and there will be visitors every day.[/color][/*]\n<br />[*][color=#D4D4D8]Join the Paradise Island Festival\u00A0Market Day!!!\n<br />\n<br />[b]Tutorial video visit page original Author[/b]\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/19309?tab=description]Market Town[/url]\u00A0[/color]\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[center][b][u]\n<br />\n<br />[color=#ffd966][size=3]NOTE :[/size][/color][/u][/b][/center]\n<br />[center][b][color=#ffd966]Market Log only work with Gamepad[/color][/b][/center]\n<br />[center][color=#ffe599][b]but does not affect the mechanism the mod runs perfectly[/b][/color][/center]\n<br />[/*]\n<br />[/list]\n<br />\n<br />[center][color=#D4D4D8][b][size=4]Big Thanks to original author [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/profile/HaPyke/mods]HaPyke[/url]\u00A0make this awesome mods![/size][/b][/color][/center]\n<br />",
